      "type": "text",
      "x": 92.0,
      "y": 904,
      "width": 924,
      "height": 83,
      "text": "Wrap-not-build discipline (v4.1 Section 5):\n 1. Read official docs before integration (AGENTS.md Section 11.12)\n 2. Exact-pin in pyproject.toml (Constraint #11): duckdb==1.1.3, polars==1.18.0, pyiceberg==0.11.1, dagster==1.9.5, litellm==1.83.14\n 3. One-component-per-PR upgrades; major versions require an ADR\n 4. Each Tier 1 engine: clean swap interface + 5-10 smoke tests in CI; full adapter built ON-DEMAND (Composability Tax avoided)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Wrap-not-build discipline (v4.1 Section 5):\n 1. Read official docs before integration (AGENTS.md Section 11.12)\n 2. Exact-pin in pyproject.toml (Constraint #11): duckdb==1.1.3, polars==1.18.0, pyiceberg==0.11.1, dagster==1.9.5, litellm==1.83.14\n 3. One-component-per-PR upgrades; major versions require an ADR\n 4. Each Tier 1 engine: clean swap interface + 5-10 smoke tests in CI; full adapter built ON-DEMAND (Composability Tax avoided)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
